      "name": "Death Coil Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Arthas's Death Coil Build is designed to increase his damage from the distance, his team's burst damage, and his self-sustain. We find this Build particularly good against ranged Heroes.\n\nFrost Presence at Level 1 makes both your engage and your peeling reliable. The burst damage comes from Shattered Armor at Level 4 and Deathlord at Level 13.\n\nWhen playing against Heroes with slow but heavy hitting Basic Attacks, pick Rime at Level 1. When playing against Heroes who deal a lot of damage with Abilities, pick Anti-Magic Shell at Level 16.",
