    {
      "name": "Frozen Tempest Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Arthas's Frozen Tempest Build allows him to cripple the enemy team's advance or retreat by further increasing the power and utility of Frozen Tempest. We find this Build particularly good against melee Heroes with low-mobility.\n\nBorean Winds at Level 1 gives a moderate amount of mobility, Biting Cold at Level 13 increases your damage output, and Remorseless Winter at Level 16 provides another way to Root enemy Heroes.\n\nWhen playing against Heroes with slow but heavy hitting Basic Attacks, pick Rime at Level 1. When playing against Heroes who deal a lot of damage with Abilities, pick Anti-Magic Shell at Level 16.",
